[
  {
    "content_id": "10031001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是俄巴底亚看到的异象。 我们从耶和华那里听到消息， 有位使者被派去对列国说： “起来，我们去攻打以东吧！” 关于以东，主耶和华说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“看啊，我要使你在列国中最弱小， 备受藐视。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你住在岩穴中， 居住在高山上， 自以为谁也不能把你拉下来， 但你的骄傲欺骗了你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;即使你如鹰高飞， 在星辰间搭窝， 我也必把你拉下来。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;“盗贼夜间来你家， 难道不只偷所需要的吗？ 人们到你那里摘葡萄， 难道不留下几串吗？ 但你会被彻底毁灭！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;以扫要被洗劫一空， 他藏的珍宝要被搜去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你的盟友将你逐出家园； 你的朋友欺骗你，战胜你； 你的知己设陷阱害你， 你却懵然不知。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：“到那天， 我要毁灭以东的智者， 除掉以扫山上的明哲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;提幔的勇士必惊慌失措， 以扫山上的人尽遭杀戮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;“因你曾残暴地对待同胞兄弟雅各， 你必蒙羞，永遭毁灭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;当外人掠夺雅各的财物、 异族攻入耶路撒冷的城门抽签分赃时， 你竟然袖手旁观， 就像他们的同伙一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你的亲族遭难之日， 你不该幸灾乐祸； 犹大人被灭的日子， 你不该兴高采烈； 他们遭难的日子， 你不该口出狂言；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我子民遭难的日子， 你不该闯进他们的城； 他们遭难的日子， 你不该幸灾乐祸； 他们遭难的日子， 你不该趁火打劫；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你不该站在路口截杀那些逃亡者； 他们遭难的日子， 你不该把幸存者交给仇敌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;“耶和华惩罚万国的日子近了。 必按你的所作所为报应你， 你的恶行必落到自己头上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;犹大人在我的圣山上怎样饱饮愤怒， 万国也要照样不停地喝， 且要大口吞下， 直到他们完全消逝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;“然而，锡安山必成为避难所， 成为圣地。 雅各家必得到自己的产业。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;雅各家将成为火， 约瑟家将成为烈焰， 以扫家将成为碎秸， 被火焚烧、吞噬，无一人逃脱。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;“南地的人将占领以扫山； 丘陵的人将占领非利士， 夺取以法莲和撒玛利亚； 便雅悯人将占领基列。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;被掳的以色列人将占领迦南人的土地，远至撒勒法； 从耶路撒冷被掳到西法拉的人将占领南地各城。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亚书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;拯救者必登上锡安山， 统治以扫山， 耶和华必做王掌权。”</p>"
  }
]